ttgtnh.config.scale.tooltip=Minecraft font scale, 0.1-10. Long text is reduced to fit the maximum width. PNG title images keep their resource-defined size.
ttgtnh.config.subtitleScale.tooltip=Subtitle font scale, 0.1-10. Long text is reduced to fit the maximum width.
ttgtnh.config.color.tooltip=Six hexadecimal digits without #, for example FFFFFF (white) or FFD700 (gold). Applies to text, not PNG title images.
ttgtnh.config.subtitleColor.tooltip=Six hexadecimal digits without #, for example CCCCCC (light gray).
ttgtnh.config.anchorX.tooltip=0 = left, 0.5 = center, 1 = right. The title is centered on this point, then offset is added.
ttgtnh.config.anchorY.tooltip=0 = top, 0.5 = middle, 1 = bottom. Positions the top of the title before vertical offset.
ttgtnh.config.x.tooltip=Negative moves left; positive moves right. Measured in scaled GUI pixels.
ttgtnh.config.y.tooltip=Negative moves up; positive moves down. Measured in scaled GUI pixels.
ttgtnh.config.maxWidth.tooltip=0.05-1 of screen width. Text that exceeds this width is automatically reduced.
